  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Conventional infantry within the DCMS serve as the foundation of planetary defense, providing the manpower essential to territorial control while freeing BattleMech and armored assets for offensive operations. The platoon tows a light LB-X autocannon that can switch between solid slugs for armor penetration and cluster rounds for area effect. That flexibility makes it effective against both vehicles and dispersed infantry without requiring a change of position or a second weapon system.</p>"
